# Dependencies
node_modules/
.node_modules_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment - NEVER commit. These contain credentials (API keys, access tokens, passwords).
# The glob deliberately catches operator-made copies too (.env.backup,
# .env.production, .env.old ...) — a copied secrets file is still a secrets file.
.env*
# ...but the example file is documentation, not a secret — keep it trackable.
!.env.example
.mcp.json
# Microsoft OAuth token cache (Outlook / Microsoft 365 mailboxes) — holds a
# refresh token, i.e. a durable credential. Written by scripts/ms_oauth.py.
# The trailing * is load-bearing: the cache is written atomically via a
# temporary sibling (.ms-token.json.<random>.tmp) which a hard kill can leave
# behind, and a bare `.ms-token.json` would not match it — letting a live
# refresh token be committed by anyone who git-inits their project folder.
.ms-token.json*
# WhatsApp pairing QR — a device-linking credential. Deleted when pairing
# completes, but a timed-out/interrupted pairing can leave it behind.
whatsapp-qr.png

# Build outputs (root-level only; the build/ skill dir must NOT be ignored)
.next/
out/
/build/
/dist/
*.log
pipeline.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Vercel / Cloudflare / Netlify deploy tooling
.vercel/
.wrangler/
.netlify/

# Client build artefacts are local-only runtime output, not meant for git.
# Each pipeline run produces hundreds of files per client (gathered content,
# generated site source, screenshots) which add up fast. Vercel preserves
# deployed sites and Supabase holds pipeline state — clients/ on disk is the
# operational scratch space, not the canonical record. Inert if you didn't
# git-init your workspace.
clients/

# Playwright
.playwright-cli/

# Parallel-orchestration scratch (per-run .summary / .cmd / .log children write here)
orchestrator-logs/

# Local Claude state (per-machine)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Transient `klaudius update` working state. The manifest itself
# (.klaudius/manifest.json) is deliberately NOT ignored — commit it.
.klaudius/incoming/
.klaudius/conflicts.md
.klaudius/backup/
.klaudius/base/

# Backups
*.bak
*~
